" means, so I'll check the date and the time zone with `date` before running any searches.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_016q1r3QPFYE4fwp7L1CNShP\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"date; date -u; cat /etc/localtime 2>/dev/null | head -c 0; readlink /etc/localtime 2>/dev/null; echo $TZ\",\"timeout\":null}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_016q1r3QPFYE4fwp7L1CNShP\",\"content\":\"Sun Nov  8 17:59:48 PST 2026\\nMon Nov  9 01:59:48 UTC 2026\\nhead: illegal byte count -- 0\\n/var/db/timezone/zoneinfo/America/Los_Angeles\\n\\n\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Today is Sunday, Nov 8, 2026, so tomorrow is Monday, Nov 9. I'm taking America/Los_Angeles as the time zone since it's the local system zone, though I should flag that as an inference. Next I'm searching the calendar, Dana's email, and the budget spreadsheet at the same time.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01Q4iU5u8EWtAV6MK5MP4rSX\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"tools call calendar.list --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"from\\\":\\\"2026-11-09T00:00:00-08:00\\\",\\\"to\\\":\\\"2026-11-10T00:00:00-08:00\\\",\\\"limit\\\":100}\\nJSON\\necho ---\\ntools call mail.search --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget\\\",\\\"from\\\":\\\"Dana\\\",\\\"limit\\\":25}\\nJSON\\necho ---\\ntools call drive.search --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"query\\\":\\\"budget\\\",\\\"limit\\\":25}\\nJSON\",\"timeout\":null}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01Q4iU5u8EWtAV6MK5MP4rSX\",\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"events\\\": []\\n}\\n---\\n{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_20a91630a7dd4079\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_4c188dedc81549a6\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ]\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n---\\n{\\n  \\\"files\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_ca0373214f234d83\\\",\\n      \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n      \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n      \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n      \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"The calendar came back empty for tomorrow, Nov 9 Pacific. The sent timestamp also lands on Nov 9 Pacific, so the dates line up. I'll read the full email next to confirm the details before deciding whether to widen the calendar check.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_016Lpd4Fn6FQJyepwyKCAgFP\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"tools call mail.read --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"message\\\":\\\"msg_20a91630a7dd4079\\\"}\\nJSON\\necho ---\\ntools call drive.read --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"file\\\":\\\"file_ca0373214f234d83\\\"}\\nJSON\",\"timeout\":null}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_016Lpd4Fn6FQJyepwyKCAgFP\",\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"messages\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"message\\\": \\\"msg_20a91630a7dd4079\\\",\\n      \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_4c188dedc81549a6\\\",\\n      \\\"from\\\": {\\n        \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\",\\n        \\\"name\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\"\\n      },\\n      \\\"to\\\": [\\n        {\\n          \\\"email\\\": \\\"me@example.test\\\",\\n          \\\"name\\\": \\\"Sam Example\\\"\\n        }\\n      ],\\n      \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\n      \\\"snippet\\\": \\\"Can you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's review?\\\",\\n      \\\"sent_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-09T08:12:00Z\\\",\\n      \\\"unread\\\": true,\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"INBOX\\\",\\n        \\\"UNREAD\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"body\\\": {\\n        \\\"text\\\": \\\"Hi Sam,\\\\n\\\\nCan you bring the latest budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review? Finance wants the Q3 travel line.\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nDana\\\",\\n        \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n        \\\"limit_chars\\\": 20000\\n      },\\n      \\\"attachments\\\": []\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\\n---\\n{\\n  \\\"file\\\": \\\"file_ca0373214f234d83\\\",\\n  \\\"name\\\": \\\"Q3 Budget\\\",\\n  \\\"mime_type\\\": \\\"application/vnd.google-apps.spreadsheet\\\",\\n  \\\"modified_at\\\": \\\"2026-11-08T17:00:00Z\\\",\\n  \\\"modified_by\\\": \\\"Dana Example\\\",\\n  \\\"native_type\\\": \\\"spreadsheet\\\",\\n  \\\"web_url\\\": \\\"https://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\",\\n  \\\"text\\\": {\\n    \\\"text\\\": \\\"line,q2,q3\\\\ntravel,12000,15500\\\\nsoftware,8000,8200\\\\nevents,4000,6500\\\",\\n    \\\"truncated\\\": false,\\n    \\\"limit_chars\\\": 100000\\n  },\\n  \\\"exported_as\\\": \\\"text/csv\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"is_error\":false}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"I'm checking that tomorrow's calendar is clear, then drafting a reply to Dana. The draft will refer to her \\\"planning review\\\" as simply \\\"the review,\\\" go to dana@example.test under a \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\" subject, and include the spreadsheet link.\\n\\n\",\"signature\":\"\"},{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01CNE6epyjrnMnEMzZjvCHxy\",\"name\":\"bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"tools call mail.draft --json - <<'JSON'\\n{\\\"reply_to\\\":\\\"msg_20a91630a7dd4079\\\",\\\"to\\\":[\\\"dana@example.test\\\"],\\\"subject\\\":\\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\",\\\"body\\\":\\\"Hi Dana,\\\\n\\\\nYes, I'll bring the budget sheet to tomorrow's planning review. Here's the link to the Q3 Budget sheet:\\\\n\\\\nhttps://docs.example.test/spreadsheets/d/f-budget\\\\n\\\\nThanks,\\\\nSam\\\"}\\nJSON\",\"timeout\":null}}]},{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01CNE6epyjrnMnEMzZjvCHxy\",\"content\":\"{\\n  \\\"draft\\\": \\\"msg_f6adb468f30b4505\\\",\\n  \\\"thread\\\": \\\"thr_4c188dedc81549a6\\\",\\n  \\\"to\\\": [\\n    {\\n      \\\"email\\\": \\\"dana@example.test\\\"\\n    }\\n  ],\\n  \\\"subject\\\": \\\"Re: Q3 budget numbers\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"is_error\":false,\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}]},{\"role\":\"system\",\"content\":[],\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"high\"}}],\"max_tokens\":128000,\"stream\":true,\"system\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"You are a conformance fixture.\\n\\nConformance agent\\n\\n<skills>\\nThe following skills provide specialized instructions for specific tasks.\\nUse the read tool to load a skill's file when the task matches its description.\\nResolve relative paths against the skill's directory (parent of SKILL.md). Use absolute paths in tool calls.\\n\\n<available_skills>\\n  <skill>\\n    <name>productivity</name>\\n    <description>How to use the mail, calendar and drive tools well. Load it before searching, reading, drafting or sending mail, scheduling or answering meetings, or finding, reading or uploading files.</description>\\n    <location>/repo/skills/productivity/SKILL.md</location>\\n  </skill>\\n</available_skills>\\n</skills>\\n\\n<cwd>\\n/tmp/recipe-conformance-Zx8OCh/workspace\\n</cwd>\",\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}}],\"tools\":[{\"name\":\"bash\",\"description\":\"Execute a bash command in the current working directory. Returns stdout and stderr. Output is truncated to last 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). If truncated, full output is saved to a temp file. Optionally provide a timeout in seconds.\\n\\nmail, calendar, drive are not tools you call directly: reach them from bash with the `tools` command. `tools list` shows them, `tools list <tool> --schema` a tool's commands and arguments, `tools call <tool>.<command> --json -` with the arguments on stdin in a quoted heredoc (`<<'JSON'`), so quotes in them need no escaping, makes one call, and `tools run` with a script on stdin (`await tools.<tool>.<command>({...})`) makes several.\",\"eager_input_streaming\":true,\"strict\":true,\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"command\",\"timeout\"],\"properties\":{\"command\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Shell command to execute\"},\"timeout\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Timeout in seconds (optional, no default timeout)\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]}},\"additionalProperties\":false}},{\"name\":\"read\",\"description\":\"Read the contents of a file. Supports text files and images (jpg, png, gif, webp, bmp). Images are sent as attachments. For text files, output is truncated to 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). Use offset/limit for large files. When you need the full file, continue with offset until complete.\",\"eager_input_streaming\":true,\"strict\":true,\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"required\":[\"path\",\"offset\",\"limit\"],\"properties\":{\"path\":{\"type\":\"string\",\"description\":\"Path to the file to read (relative or absolute)\"},\"offset\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Line number to start reading from (1-indexed)\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]},\"limit\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"type\":\"number\",\"description\":\"Maximum number of lines to read\"},{\"type\":\"null\"}]}},\"additionalProperties\":false},\"cache_control\":{\"type\":\"ephemeral\"}},{\"name\":\"__pi_deferred_placeholder__\",\"description\":\"Reserved placeholder. Never available. Never call this.\",\"input_schema\":{\"type\":\"object\",\"properties\":{},\"required\":[]},\"defer_loading\":true}],\"thinking\":{\"type\":\"adaptive\",\"display\":\"summarized\",\"block_binding\":{\"prefix_mismatch_behavior\":\"drop_block\"}},\"output_config\":{\"effort\":\"low\"}}"
